comments.body:
Add plots to show the accumulated material along the track and compare to geant4 material.

The plots can show:
- mean t/X0 and mean t/L0 accumulated up to r, in the barrel region, for small |eta|;
- mean t/X0 and mean t/L0 accumulated up to |z|, in forward |eta| slices;
- mean t/X0 and mean t/L0 accumulated up d = √(r² + z²), where d is the distance from the origin, for all |eta| slices.

